        "id": 7758,
        "name": "j1hopki1",
        "username": "j1hopki1",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-20T05:12:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I know this has been discussed, but it came up in play again and I forgot the ruling.</p><p>Informant says when a hero card is played, play the top card of the villain deck. If that hero card does 2 damage to her to kill her would her effect trigger? If the card is a static effect (like Armored Plating) or a triggered effect (like Driving Mantis) be in effect when the villain card enters play?</p><p>Same question for Negative or Positive Energy Field and Surprise Shopping Trip. Would an Environment destruction card destroy first or would the when a card is played effect be first. What about the static and triggered effect like above?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:06.762Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 7755,
        "topic_slug": "when-a-a-card-enters-play-triggers",
        "display_username": "j1hopki1",
        "primary_group_name": null,
