        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I know this has been discussed, but it came up in play again and I forgot the ruling.</p><p>Informant says when a hero card is played, play the top card of the villain deck. If that hero card does 2 damage to her to kill her would her effect trigger? If the card is a static effect (like Armored Plating) or a triggered effect (like Driving Mantis) be in effect when the villain card enters play?</p><p>Same question for Negative or Positive Energy Field and Surprise Shopping Trip. Would an Environment destruction card destroy first or would the when a card is played effect be first. What about the static and triggered effect like above?</p>",
