      {
        "id": 60606,
        "name": "pwatson1974",
        "username": "pwatson1974",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-20T08:43:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The card in play triggers before the card put into play does, I believe. This causes some issues with Matriarch and Hairtrigger Reflexes, though.</p><p>And in the Informant's case, as she plays a card as the other card is coming into play it would not yet actually be in play when any nastiness she creates hammers the heroes.</p>",
