        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-20T16:37:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Fortunately (?), The Matriarch's issue could easily be resolved by putting the \"play the top card\" effect on all of her Fowl cards on her Villain character card (though I am ALL FOR Expat completely demolishing the birds without a bunch of avian Snapple facts being rammed into the highest HP hero).&nbsp; I imagine that will be the decision if/when there is an Enhanced Edition Rook City.</p>",
